# A Journey Begins (abyssea 160), below level 30: a level 29 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted (a GM). The
# login's zone-in: no section (level 29): no 324. Joachim at Prog 0 and, after a GM's Prog 1, at Prog 1: no section: his
# script plays nothing (Dawn of Death not accepted).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onZoneIn/1
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=29
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins accepted
login                                   # level 29: no section: no 324
trigger Joachim                         # no section: nothing
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[8][160]Prog 1             # a GM
trigger Joachim                         # level 29 at Prog 1: no section: nothing
finish-if-event
rezone                                  # no 324
